7. Conclusion

The meeting concluded with a clear understanding of the Week 04 objectives and the responsibilities of each team member.

The team agreed to focus on transforming the existing simulator into a properly structured multi-process system. Special emphasis would be placed on process separation, POSIX IPC, integration and performance evaluation.

The ultimate goal is to demonstrate a fully functional simulator with communication between the UI, Core and Logging processes while understanding the architectural and performance trade-offs involved.

